!   NOTE: 6.07 does NOT have CAPCHA, UCAP, SIGMAUCAP, CHA0, CHAMIN, !
!         SINTABLE, SINTAIL1, SINTAIL2, TAUWBUG, VISCSTRESS          !
! -------------------------------------------------------------------- !
&SIN4
