!         6.07 has SDSBR2, SDSHFGEN, SDSLFGEN, FXINCUT, FXDSCUT     !
!         6.07 does NOT have SDSFACMTF, SDSNMTF, SDSCUMP, CUMSIGP,  !
!           WHITECAPDUR, SDSMWD, SDSMWPOW, SDKOF, SDSBT, SDSNUW     !
! -------------------------------------------------------------------- !
&SDS4
